  "\ud83c\udf09 SoifGo is your ultimate mobile sandbox and bridge to custom apps.": "\ud83c\udf09 SoifGo \u00e9 seu sandbox m\u00f3vel definitivo e a ponte para apps personalizados.",
  "What is SoifGo?": "O que \u00e9 o SoifGo?",
  "SoifGo is an Android-based hardware control and application platform designed for makers, embedded developers, students, engineers and IoT builders.": "O SoifGo \u00e9 uma plataforma de controle de hardware e aplicativos baseada em Android, projetada para makers, desenvolvedores embarcados, estudantes, engenheiros e criadores de IoT.",
  "Instead of creating a complete native Android application, users can build interfaces with HTML, CSS and JavaScript and run them directly inside SoifGo through an integrated WebView bridge.": "Em vez de criar um aplicativo Android nativo completo, os usu\u00e1rios podem construir interfaces com HTML, CSS e JavaScript e execut\u00e1-las diretamente dentro do SoifGo por meio de uma bridge WebView integrada.",
  "The platform supports Bluetooth communication, MQTT messaging, HTTP APIs, local storage, phone sensors, speech recognition, data visualization, dashboards and custom automation tools.": "A plataforma oferece suporte a comunica\u00e7\u00e3o Bluetooth, mensagens MQTT, APIs HTTP, armazenamento local, sensores do telefone, reconhecimento de fala, visualiza\u00e7\u00e3o de dados, pain\u00e9is e ferramentas de automa\u00e7\u00e3o personalizadas.",
  "SoifGo works with Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, Raspberry Pi, HC-05/BLE Bluetooth modules and many other embedded devices.": "O SoifGo funciona com Arduino, ESP32, ESP8266, Raspberry Pi, m\u00f3dulos Bluetooth HC-05/BLE e muitos outros dispositivos embarcados.",
  "Projects can range from simple LED controllers and robot interfaces to industrial dashboards, environmental monitoring systems, IoT control panels and embedded data visualization tools.": "Os projetos podem variar de simples controladores de LED e interfaces de rob\u00f4s a pain\u00e9is industriais, sistemas de monitoramento ambiental, pain\u00e9is de controle de IoT e ferramentas de visualiza\u00e7\u00e3o de dados embarcadas.",
  "Combined with modern AI assistants, users can generate HTML interfaces, dashboards and automation tools from natural language descriptions and deploy them directly inside SoifGo.": "Combinado com assistentes de IA modernos, os usu\u00e1rios podem gerar interfaces HTML, pain\u00e9is e ferramentas de automa\u00e7\u00e3o a partir de descri\u00e7\u00f5es em linguagem natural e implant\u00e1-los diretamente dentro do SoifGo.",
