  ". Choose the second one. A": ". Escolha a segunda. Um",
  "Select Edit": "Select Edit",
  "dialog then shows four options:": "di\u00e1logo mostra ent\u00e3o quatro op\u00e7\u00f5es:",
  "Create (+)": "Create (+)",
  "File Explorer": "File Explorer",
