  "(the soifgo folder). The user may choose any; for a first start recommend": "(a pasta soifgo). O usu\u00e1rio pode escolher qualquer uma; para o primeiro in\u00edcio recomende",
  ". Confirm the name (or rename) and finish.": ". Confirme o nome (ou renomeie) e finalize.",
  "Run it.": "Execute-o.",
  "Tap the menu icon (Pause) and choose": "Toque no \u00edcone de menu (Pause) e escolha",
  "Play": "Play",
  ". Tap the button. The WebView opens with a blank welcome page, ready for editing.": ". Toque no bot\u00e3o. O WebView abre com uma p\u00e1gina de boas-vindas em branco, pronta para edi\u00e7\u00e3o.",
  "Edit the code.": "Edite o c\u00f3digo.",
  "With the WebView open, tap the menu icon (Play) and choose": "Com o WebView aberto, toque no \u00edcone de menu (Play) e escolha",
  "Edit": "Edit",
  "to open the code editor (a notepad with syntax colors). No extra dialog appears. Paste the code you provided. Shortcut: the last item of the editor menu,": "para abrir o editor de c\u00f3digo (um bloco de notas com cores de sintaxe). Nenhum di\u00e1logo extra aparece. Cole o c\u00f3digo que voc\u00ea forneceu. Atalho: o \u00faltimo item do menu do editor,",
  "Select All and Paste": "Select All and Paste",
  ", replaces everything with the clipboard. Saving is automatic. Undo/Redo (arrows in the top bar) keeps working after the WebView is closed and resets only when the whole app is closed.": ", substitui tudo pela \u00e1rea de transfer\u00eancia. O salvamento \u00e9 autom\u00e1tico. Desfazer/Refazer (setas na barra superior) continua funcionando depois que o WebView \u00e9 fechado e s\u00f3 \u00e9 redefinido quando todo o app \u00e9 fechado.",
  "Rename HTML": "Rename HTML",
  "Save As HTML": "Save As HTML",
  "in the editor menu are optional manual options.": "no menu do editor s\u00e3o op\u00e7\u00f5es manuais opcionais.",
  "The \u2716 button colors.": "As cores do bot\u00e3o \u2716.",
  "Red \u2716": "\u2716 vermelho",
  "= the WebView is running; tapping it closes the WebView.": "= o WebView est\u00e1 em execu\u00e7\u00e3o; toc\u00e1-lo fecha o WebView.",
  "Yellow \u2716": "\u2716 amarelo",
  "= the WebView is in edit mode; tapping it saves, leaves the editor and returns to run mode right away, so the user sees the result. To change the code again, choose Edit again.": "= o WebView est\u00e1 no modo edi\u00e7\u00e3o; toc\u00e1-lo salva, sai do editor e volta imediatamente ao modo execu\u00e7\u00e3o, para que o usu\u00e1rio veja o resultado. Para alterar o c\u00f3digo de novo, escolha Edit novamente.",
  "When you write the code.": "Quando voc\u00ea escrever o c\u00f3digo.",
  "Give one complete HTML file (CSS and JavaScript inside) that the user can paste in one go. Never invent bridge names; for Bluetooth especially, read": "Forne\u00e7a um arquivo HTML completo (com CSS e JavaScript dentro) que o usu\u00e1rio possa colar de uma s\u00f3 vez. Nunca invente nomes da bridge; especialmente para Bluetooth, leia",
