  "Scientific calculator with trigonometric, logarithm and square root keys, built by an AI assistant and running in SoifGo": "Calculadora cient\u00edfica com teclas trigonom\u00e9tricas, logar\u00edtmicas e de raiz quadrada, constru\u00edda por um assistente de IA e rodando no SoifGo",
